#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->enable-sound->description
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->enable-sound->description
msgid "Allow Burn My Windows to override cinnamon sound effects"
msgstr "Salli Burn My Windows ohittaa Cinnamon ääniefektit"

#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->enable-sound->tooltip
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->enable-sound->tooltip
msgid ""
"Allow Burn My Windows to override Cinnamon's window open/close/minimize "
"sound effects with unique ones defined in the Effect Settings tab for each "
"Burn My Windows effect. Note: Sounds will only play when Cinnamon's open/"
"close/minimize sound effects are enabled under Cinnamon sounds settings. The "
"default cinnamon sounds will be used unless a sound effect file is chosen "
"for the active Burn My Windows effect."
msgstr ""
"Voit sallia Burn My Windows korvata Cinnamon ikkunoiden avaamiseen, "
"sulkemiseen ja pienentämiseen liittyvät ääniefektit omilla äänillä "
"Efektiasetukset -välilehdessä. Huomaa: Äänet kuuluvat vain, jos Cinnamon "
"asetuksissa on käytössä ääniefektit ja Burn My Windows -efektille ole "
"valittu oma äänitiedosto."

#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->dialog-special->description
#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->power-dialog-special->description
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->dialog-special->description
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->power-dialog-special->description
msgid "Special handling for dialog windows"
msgstr "Käsittely valintaikkunossa"

#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->dialog-special->tooltip
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->dialog-special->tooltip
msgid ""
"Allows you to define special settings for handling dialog window types (i.e. "
"file open dialog windows). These settings will override any application "
"specific settings that may have been defined."
msgstr ""
"Mahdollistaa asetusten määrittämisen valintaikkunaan (kuten ikkunaan "
"tiedoston avaamiseksi). Asetukset ohittavat sovelluksen omat asetukset."

#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->dialog-open-effect->description
#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->power-dialog-open-effect->description
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->dialog-open-effect->description
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->power-dialog-open-effect->description
msgid "Open dialog window effect"
msgstr "Tehoste Ikkunan avaamiselle"

#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->dialog-close-effect->description
#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->power-dialog-close-effect->description
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->dialog-close-effect->description
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->power-dialog-close-effect->description
msgid "Close dialog window effect"
msgstr "Tehoste Ikkunan sulkemiselle"

#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->minimize-effect->description
#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->power-minimize-effect->description
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->minimize-effect->description
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->power-minimize-effect->description
msgid "Minimize window effect"
msgstr "Tehoste Ikkunan pienentämiselle"

#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->unminimize-effect->description
#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->power-unminimize-effect->description
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->unminimize-effect->description
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->power-unminimize-effect->description
msgid "Unminimize window effect"
msgstr "Tehoste Ikkunan palauttamiselle"

#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->power-dialog-special->tooltip
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->power-dialog-special->tooltip
msgid ""
"Allows you to define special settings for handling dialog window types (i.e. "
"file open dialog windows)."
msgstr ""
"Mahdollistaa asetusten määrittämisen valintaikkunaan (kuten ikkunaan "
"tiedoston avaamiseksi)."

#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->power-onbattery->description
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->power-onbattery->description
msgid "Use different effects when running on battery power"
msgstr "Eri tehosteet käytössä kun kone käyttää akkua"

#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->power-onbattery->tooltip
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->power-onbattery->tooltip
msgid ""
"When enabled, a set of options will appear allowing you to define which "
"effects (if any) will be used when running on battery power and the battery "
"charge state is less than the set limit. These settings will take precedence "
"over both the general settings and any application specific settings when "
"the battery charge state condition is met."
msgstr ""
"Kun käytössä näkyviin tulee valintoja, mitä tehosteita (jos mitään) "
"käytetään, kun kone saa virtansa akusta ja varaustaso on rajaa alhaisempi. "
"Nämä asetukset ohittavat koneen omat ja sovellusten asetukset."

#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->power-percent->description
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->power-percent->description
msgid "When battery is less than (percent)"
msgstr "Kun akun varaustaso on alle (prosenttia)"

#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->aperture-panels-panel-size->description
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->aperture-panels-panel-size->description
msgid "Panel Size (px)"
msgstr "Paneelin koko (px)"

#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->aperture-panels-panel-size->tooltip
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->aperture-panels-panel-size->tooltip
msgid ""
"The approximate size of the panels. It is adjusted a little so that a whole "
"number of panels fits the window exactly."
msgstr ""
"Paneelien likimääräinen koko säätää niin että paneelit sopii täsmälleen "
"ikkunaan."

#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->aperture-panels-wave-shape->options
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->aperture-panels-wave-shape->options
msgid "Diagonal"
msgstr "Vinoviiva"

#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->aperture-panels-wave-shape->options
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->aperture-panels-wave-shape->options
msgid "Arc from a corner"
msgstr "Kaari kulma"

#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->aperture-panels-wave-shape->options
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->aperture-panels-wave-shape->options
msgid "Wavy diagonal"
msgstr "Aaltoileva vinoviiva"

#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->aperture-panels-wave-shape->options
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->aperture-panels-wave-shape->options
msgid "Organic diagonal"
msgstr "Orgaaninen vinoviiva"

#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->aperture-panels-wave-shape->options
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->aperture-panels-wave-shape->options
msgid "Ripple from the center"
msgstr "Väreilyä keskellä"

#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->aperture-panels-wave-shape->options
#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->aperture-panels-flip-axis->options
#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->magiclamp-effect->options
